{"id":"circular","label":"Circular Network","description":"Nodes on a circle grouped by category, sized by number of connections, with curved edges coloured by their source.","howTo":["Bind `series[0].data` to nodes `{name, category, value, symbolSize}` and `series[0].links` to edges `{source, target}` (node names).","`category` is an index into `series[0].categories`; the legend lists the same names. Nodes are placed in data order, so sort them by category to keep the groups together.","Node size is not computed: write `symbolSize` per node (here 8 px plus 2.6 px per connection) in the query or a script transform.","The four margins leave room for the rotated labels; increase them for longer names."],"props":{"option":{"tooltip":{},"legend":[{"data":["Controller","Sensor","Actuator","Server"],"top":4}],"animationDurationUpdate":1500,"animationEasingUpdate":"quinticInOut","series":[{"name":"Tag dependencies","type":"graph","layout":"circular","circular":{"rotateLabel":true},"top":100,"bottom":70,"left":120,"right":120,"roam":true,"data":[{"name":"PLC-Mix","category":0,"value":9,"symbolSize":31},{"name":"TT-101","category":1,"value":1,"symbolSize":11},{"name":"LT-102","category":1,"value":2,"symbolSize":13},{"name":"FT-103","category":1,"value":1,"symbolSize":11},{"name":"P-101","category":2,"value":2,"symbolSize":13},{"name":"V-102","category":2,"value":1,"symbolSize":11},{"name":"M-103","category":2,"value":1,"symbolSize":11},{"name":"PLC-Past","category":0,"value":12,"symbolSize":39},{"name":"TT-201","category":1,"value":1,"symbolSize":11},{"name":"PT-202","category":1,"value":2,"symbolSize":13},{"name":"FT-203","category":1,"value":2,"symbolSize":13},{"name":"TT-204","category":1,"value":2,"symbolSize":13},{"name":"P-201","category":2,"value":3,"symbolSize":16},{"name":"V-202","category":2,"value":1,"symbolSize":11},{"name":"V-203","category":2,"value":2,"symbolSize":13},{"name":"PLC-Fill","category":0,"value":8,"symbolSize":29},{"name":"LT-301","category":1,"val