{"id":"force","label":"Force Layout Network","description":"Self-arranging force-directed layout with categories, a legend and draggable nodes.","howTo":["Bind `series[0].data` to nodes `{name, category, value, symbolSize}` and `series[0].links` to `{source, target}`.","Tune the layout under `series[0].force`: `repulsion` pushes nodes apart, `edgeLength` is the preferred link length (`[min, max]`), `gravity` pulls everything to the centre.","The layout is recalculated whenever the data binding delivers a new list, so nodes can move. For a stable picture bind rarely, or use the circular or fixed-position examples.","`labelLayout.hideOverlap` drops labels that would collide."],"props":{"option":{"tooltip":{},"legend":[{"data":["Controller","Sensor","Actuator","Server"],"top":4}],"series":[{"name":"Tag dependencies","type":"graph","layout":"force","top":50,"roam":true,"draggable":true,"force":{"repulsion":260,"edgeLength":[40,90],"gravity":0.2,"layoutAnimation":false},"data":[{"name":"PLC-Mix","category":0,"value":9,"symbolSize":28},{"name":"TT-101","category":1,"value":1,"symbolSize":10},{"name":"LT-102","category":1,"value":2,"symbolSize":12},{"name":"FT-103","category":1,"value":1,"symbolSize":10},{"name":"P-101","category":2,"value":2,"symbolSize":12},{"name":"V-102","category":2,"value":1,"symbolSize":10},{"name":"M-103","category":2,"value":1,"symbolSize":10},{"name":"PLC-Past","category":0,"value":12,"symbolSize":34},{"name":"TT-201","category":1,"value":1,"symbolSize":10},{"name":"PT-202","category":1,"value":2,"symbolSize":12},{"name":"FT-203","category":1,"value":2,"symbolSize":12},{"name":"TT-204","category":1,"value":2,"symbolSize":12},{"name":"P-201","category":2,"value":3,"symbolSize":15},{"name":"V-202","category":2,"value":1,"symbolSize":10},{"name":"V-203","category":2,"value":2,"symbolSize":12},{"name":"PLC-Fill","category":0,"value":8,"symbolSize":26},{"name":"LT-301","category":1,"value":2,"symbolSize":12},{"name":"PT-302","category":1,"value":1,"sy