{"id":"state-machine","label":"State Machine","description":"Directed graph with fixed node positions, arrow heads and labelled transitions.","howTo":["Nodes have fixed positions: `series[0].data` is `{name, x, y, itemStyle: {color}}`. Only the relative positions matter; the chart scales them to fit.","Transitions are `series[0].links`: `{source, target, label: {formatter: \"text\"}}`. Give a pair of opposite transitions a `lineStyle.curveness` (0.25) so they do not overlap.","To show the active state, bind one node’s `itemStyle.color` (or `itemStyle.borderColor` / `borderWidth`) to the state tag, or bind the whole `data` list from a script transform."],"props":{"option":{"tooltip":{"show":false},"series":[{"type":"graph","layout":"none","top":50,"bottom":50,"left":70,"right":70,"symbol":"roundRect","symbolSize":[86,36],"roam":true,"label":{"show":true,"color":"#fff","fontSize":12},"edgeSymbol":["none","arrow"],"edgeSymbolSize":[0,10],"edgeLabel":{"show":true,"fontSize":11},"lineStyle":{"width":2,"opacity":0.9,"curveness":0},"data":[{"name":"Stopped","x":0,"y":100,"itemStyle":{"color":"#6b7280"}},{"name":"Starting","x":150,"y":0,"itemStyle":{"color":"#3d85c6"}},{"name":"Running","x":300,"y":100,"itemStyle":{"color":"#2e9e5b"}},{"name":"Held","x":300,"y":230,"itemStyle":{"color":"#d9a21b"}},{"name":"Stopping","x":150,"y":200,"itemStyle":{"color":"#3d85c6"}},{"name":"Faulted","x":0,"y":230,"itemStyle":{"color":"#d9534f"}}],"links":[{"source":"Stopped","target":"Starting","label":{"formatter":"Start"}},{"source":"Starting","target":"Running","label":{"formatter":"Ready"}},{"source":"Running","target":"Held","label":{"formatter":"Hold"},"lineStyle":{"curveness":0.25}},{"source":"Held","target":"Running","label":{"formatter":"Resume"},"lineStyle":{"curveness":0.25}},{"source":"Running","target":"Stopping","label":{"formatter":"Stop"}},{"source":"Stopping","target":"Stopped","label":{"formatter":"Done"}},{"source":"Held","target":"Faulted","label":{"formatter":"Fault"}},{"source":"Faulted","target":"Stopped","label":{"formatter":"Reset"}}]}]}}},
{"id":"cartesian","label":"Graph on Cartesian","description":"Graph nodes placed on ordinary x/y axes and joined by arrows; values on a category axis.","howTo":["The series sits on normal axes (`coordinateSystem: \"cartesian2d\"`): bind `xAxis.data` to the categories and `series[0].data` to one value per category.","`series[0].links` join data indexes (`{source: 0, target: 1}`); they must be regenerated if the number of points changes."],"props":{"option":{"tooltip":{},"grid":{"left":50,"right":30,"top":40,"bottom":40},"xAxis":{"type":"category","boundaryGap":false,"data":["Mon","Tue","Wed","Thu","Fri","Sat","Sun"]},"yAxis":{"type":"value","name":"Units"},"series":[{"type":"graph","layout":"none","coordinateSystem":"cartesian2d","symbolSize":38,"label":{"show":true,"fontSize":11},"edgeSymbol":["circle","arrow"],"edgeSymbolSize":[4,10],"lineStyle":{"width":2,"color":"source"},"data":[820,932,901,934,1290,1330,1120],"links":[{"source":0,"target":1},{"source":1,"target":2},{"source":2,"target":3},{"source":3,"target":4},{"source":4,"target":5},{"source":5,"target":6},{"source":2,"target":5,"lineStyle":{"curveness":-0.3,"type":"dashed"}}]}]}}}
